{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113154526395-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113163501\"/><p>火警引起街坊圍觀。</p><p>今日(13日)下午3時39分，一輛貨車沿屯門公路往九龍方向行駛，駛至屯門市廣場對開時，懷疑車上載運的紙皮雜物起火，火勢迅速由貨斗蔓延往車頭，產生大量黑煙，司機慌忙棄車逃生。消防接獲多名駕駛人士報案，隨即到場開喉灌救，直至下午3時57分將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，火警原因有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:44.911968+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:45:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:33:14.173060+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:08.944869+00:00","content_hash":"b5f77084e85b47dd7a09e7a05f8c13c9596be50dd981a2a9e1df321bb16e173b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:44.911968+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}